====================================================================================================
Part C. Exact S1 velocity constant from the block bounds (rigorous given (9), (10))
====================================================================================================
  S1: h = sum_{m odd} g_m sin(m theta); with x_i = ||w g_(2i+1)|| (t line) the rows are
  o_m = g_m + T_(m+1) g_(m+2) (m >= 1) and p_m = g_m + P_(m-1) g_(m-2) (m >= 3); the mode -1 output vanishes.
  Triangle inequality with ||T_n|| <= K_n, ||P_k|| <= 1 gives S <= x^T A^T A x with A^T A tridiagonal:
  d_0 = 2, d_i = 3 + K_(2i)^2 (i >= 1), e_i = 1 + K_(2i+2); and ||w U h||^2/||w h||^2 = S/(8 sum x_i^2).
